@startuml signal-processing-flow
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName sans-serif

title Signal 层主处理链路（含位置关联 / Kalman / IMM）

rectangle "环境建模输入\n传播损耗 / 杂波 / 干扰" as ENV
rectangle "回波计算\nSignalDetector" as ECHO
rectangle "信号检测\nCFAR 探测判决" as DETECT
rectangle "数据关联\nDataAssociationEngine" as ASSOC
rectangle "可选位置空间关联\n预测位置 + 量测位置 + S" as POS_ASSOC
rectangle "跟踪滤波\nTrackFilter（标量特征）" as FILTER
rectangle "TrackMeasurement 导出\nSignalPipeline bridge" as MEAS
rectangle "轨迹管理\nTrackLifecycleManager" as LIFECYCLE

rectangle "状态估计\n(集成于 LifecycleManager)" as KALMAN {
  rectangle "新轨迹\n从量测初始化\nGaussianTrackState" as INIT
  rectangle "已有轨迹\nKalman: Predict → Update\nIMM: Process\n→ 写回 position/velocity" as PU
  rectangle "未命中轨迹\nKalman/IMM 仅 Predict\n协方差膨胀 + 均值外推" as PRED_ONLY
}

rectangle "稳定航迹快照\n供决策层/目标分类使用" as SNAPSHOT
rectangle "轨迹对象池\n仅内存复用" as POOL

ENV --> ECHO
ECHO --> DETECT
DETECT --> ASSOC
ASSOC ..> POS_ASSOC
ASSOC --> FILTER
FILTER --> MEAS
MEAS --> LIFECYCLE
LIFECYCLE --> KALMAN
KALMAN --> SNAPSHOT
LIFECYCLE --> POOL : 申请/归还对象

note right of ASSOC
  输出 AssociationResult：
  - matches
  - missed_track_keys
  - unassociated_target_indices
  - target_keys

  默认：标量特征关联
  可选：位置空间关联
  （position_x/y/z + 轨迹级 S）
end note

note right of FILTER
  标量特征维护：
  speed / RCS / acceleration
  的衰减和透传。
end note

note right of MEAS
  桥接接口：
  ISignalPipeline::GetLastTrackMeasurements()

  语义字段：
  - source_index, association_key
  - has_cartesian_position（Kalman / IMM 激活条件）
  - position, velocity（空间量测）
  - measurement_covariance（动态 R 矩阵）
end note

note right of KALMAN
  状态估计激活条件：
  1. Kalman predictor/updater 或 IMM 模型集已配置
  2. measurement.has_cartesian_position == true
end note

note right of POS_ASSOC
  当前版本由 DataAssociationEngine 内部维护
  关联侧高斯状态，并通过 HPH^T + R
  计算 FullMahalanobisDistanceMetric 所需的 S。
end note

note bottom of SNAPSHOT
  分类上游应依赖稳定快照，
  而不是单帧检测或关联结果。
end note

@enduml
